.IX Title "Encode::ShiftJIS2004 3"
.TH Encode::ShiftJIS2004 3 "2013-10-29" "perl v5.34.0" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
Encode::ShiftJIS2004 \- shift_jis\-2004 \- JIS X 0213 Annex 1 encoding
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 4
\&  use Encode::ShiftJIS2004;
\&  use Encode qw/encode decode/;
\&  $bytes = encode("shift_jis\-2004", $utf8);
\&  $utf8 = decode("shift_jis\-2004", $bytes);
.Ve
.SH "ABSTRACT"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT"
This module provides followng encoding for \s-1JIS X 0213:2004\s0 Annex 1.
.PP
.Vb 4
\&  Canonical         Alias                         Description
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
\&  shift_jis\-2004    qr/\ebshift.*jis.*2004$/i      shift encoding
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
.Ve
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
To find out how to use this module in detail,
see Encode.
.SS "Note"
.IX Subsection "Note"
This encoding does not keep forward compatibility to \f(CW\*(C`ascii\*(C'\fR
but keeps conformance to the standard,
\&\f(CW"\ex5C"\fR and \f(CW"\ex7E"\fR are mapped from/to \s-1YEN SIGN\s0 and \s-1OVERLINE\s0;
\&\s-1REVERSE SOLIDUS\s0 and \s-1TILDE\s0 are mapped to/from multibyte sequences.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
Encode, Encode::JISX0213.
